cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Foresight in EU Impact Assessments: harvesting and screening pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Maggs
    given-names: Luke
date-released: "2026-07-31"
repository-code: "https://github.com/monkeymoves/eu-ia-foresight-pipeline"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Deterministic pipeline that harvests EU Commission impact assessments from
  the Register of Commission Documents, extracts page-marked text, locates
  foresight-related terminology with page-level provenance, and produces a
  reviewable dataset for human classification of foresight use.
